  "post_content": "<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2021/11/RutaDeLaTapa.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 342px;\" /></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">(6 im&aacute;genes con todas las tapas) La 11&ordf; Ruta de la Tapa se desarrolla en 16 locales de Hosturionda, tres fines de semana largos desde este&nbsp; jueves, 18 de noviembre, al domingo 5 de diciembre de 2021. Colaboran el Ayuntamiento de Onda, la Fundaci&oacute; Caixa Rural d&#39;Onda, l&#39;Exquisit Mediterrani y Mahou.</span></span></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2021/11/RutaDeLaTapaLocals.jpeg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 342px;\" /></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">El p&uacute;blico podr&aacute; votar por internet. Si lo hace un m&iacute;nimo de 14 tapas, entrar&aacute; en el sorteo de 16 cenas por valor de 50&euro; cada una.&nbsp;</span></span></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/rutadelatapa2021/rutadelatapa.jpg\" alt=\"rutadelatapa\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/rutadelatapa2021/rutadelatapalocals.jpg\" alt=\"rutadelatapalocals\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/rutadelatapa2021/tapesruta-1.jpg\" alt=\"tapesruta-1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/rutadelatapa2021/tapesruta-2.jpg\" alt=\"tapesruta-2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/rutadelatapa2021/tapesruta-3.jpg\" alt=\"tapesruta-3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/rutadelatapa2021/tapesruta-4.jpg\" alt=\"tapesruta-4\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
